mapper.select:
select `c`.`card_id`, `bco`.`coupon_name`, `bci`.`item_id`, `bti`.item_num as itemNo, `bti`.`item_name`, `bti`.`unit` as itemUnit, `bti`.`price` as itemPrice, `bci`.`quantity` as `originalQuantity`, if((`bci`.`quantity` - ifnull(`temp`.`useCount`, 0)) < 0 , 0, `bci`.`quantity` - ifnull(`temp`.`useCount`, 0)) as `remainingQuantity` from `base_card` `c` inner join `base_coupon_item` `bci` on `bci`.`coupon_id` = `c`.`coupon_id` inner join `base_coupon` `bco` on `bco`.`coupon_id` = `c`.`coupon_id` left join `base_tariff_info` `bti` on `bti`.`item_id` = `bci`.`item_id` and `bti`.`item_type` = `bci`.`type` left join (select `bb`.`item_id`, `bb`.`item_type`, `bb`.`card_id`, count(*) as `useCount` from `base_benefit` `bb` where `bb`.`card_id` in
#{item}
and `bb`.`choice_benefit_type` = 0 and `bb`.`coupon_type` in (2, 3) group by `bb`.`card_id`, `bb`.`item_id`, `bb`.`item_type` ORDER BY `bb`.`card_id` desc) `temp` on `c`.`card_id` = `temp`.`card_id` and `bci`.`item_id` = `temp`.`item_id` and `temp`.`item_type` = `bci`.`type` where `c`.`status` in (2, 3) and `bco`.`coupon_type` in (2, 3) and ( isnull(`c`.`activation_deadline`) or `c`.`activation_deadline` >= date_format(now(), '%y-%m-%d') ) and `c`.`card_id` in
#{item}
group by `c`.`card_id`, `bci`.`item_id`, `bci`.`type`,`c`.`active_date` order by `c`.`active_date`
